@startuml
title ExitPass + HikCentral Degraded Mode Flow\nProjection Snapshot Fallback

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam participantPadding 24
skinparam boxPadding 12

actor "Parker / WebPay\nor Operator Console" as User
participant "Central PMS API" as Api
participant "Resolve Vendor Parking\nUse Case" as Resolve
participant "HikCentral Vendor PMS Adapter" as Adapter
participant "HikCentral OpenAPI" as HikCentral
participant "Projection Lookup Service" as ProjectionLookup
database "ExitPass DB\nsessions.vendor_session_projections" as DB

note over Api,Resolve
DegradedResolveFallbackEnabled must be true.
Fallback is guarded and should not be enabled by default.
end note

User -> Api: POST /v1/vendor-parking/resolve\nsiteId, siteGroupId, vendorSystemId,\nticketReference/cardNum
Api -> Resolve: Execute resolve command

Resolve -> Adapter: Attempt live vendor resolve
Adapter -> HikCentral: Live lookup / fee calculation

HikCentral -x Adapter: Unavailable\nconnection refused, timeout,\nor retryable vendor failure
Adapter --> Resolve: RetryableUnavailable

alt Projection fallback enabled
    Resolve -> ProjectionLookup: Lookup latest projection snapshot\nby site + site group + vendor system + cardNum
    ProjectionLookup -> DB: Query sessions.vendor_session_projections\ncard_num = ticketReference\nprojection_status = ACTIVE\nfreshness within threshold
    DB --> ProjectionLookup: Fresh projection snapshot

    ProjectionLookup --> Resolve: ProjectionSnapshotAvailable\nnon-authoritative=true

    Resolve --> Api: Projection fallback result\nno tariff finality
    Api --> User: 503 Service Unavailable\nerrorCode=VENDOR_UNAVAILABLE_PROJECTION_SNAPSHOT_AVAILABLE\ndetails.source=projection_snapshot\ndetails.non_authoritative=true\nfreshness metadata

else Projection missing or stale
    Resolve -> ProjectionLookup: Lookup latest projection snapshot
    ProjectionLookup -> DB: Query projection by card/site/vendor
    DB --> ProjectionLookup: No fresh usable snapshot

    ProjectionLookup --> Resolve: No fallback available
    Resolve --> Api: RetryableUnavailable
    Api --> User: 503 Service Unavailable\nerrorCode=VENDOR_PMS_UNAVAILABLE\ndetails=null
end

note over Api,DB
Fallback response is continuity visibility only.
It must not be used as tariff finality,
payment finality, parking-session authority,
or exit authorization.
end note

note over Resolve
No PaymentAttempt is created.
No tariff calculation is performed from projection data.
No PaymentConfirmation is recorded.
No ExitAuthorization is issued.
end note

@enduml

